- INAV CLI, Configurator (map, receiver tab), blackbox
- MSP: 200 raw RC, 201 raw GPS, 209 set WP, MSP2 sensor messages
- MicoAssistant (set MTF-02P to MSP) + MicoAir INAV setup video
- Magnetometer module (QMC5883L / IST8310 class) if the compass test works out
- OpenCV (ORB, RANSAC, pose recovery), YOLO
- ROS: snapshot service on `/image_raw`, mission state machine, safety manager
- Later, if we need absolute position: UWB anchors or a ceiling camera